les into a happy life at the hot spring inn. Meanwhile, the girls who find themselves constantly caught up in his antics gradually begin falling for him.\n\nThis is a heartwarming harem ensemble story about Hisui and the girls, set in a rather unusual hot spring inn.","year":2026,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":["Romance","Comedy","Fantasy","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/327fd7d1-47d6-4df4-979d-20bfb8899cf2/72e5edde-3a4f-4aec-8e66-933ba80446d3.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["en"],"lane":"manga","rating":6.78,"follows":808,"listAt":"2026-10-31T05:52:07.088Z","chapters":[{"id":"422835e8-4383-4af6-9338-89cdea569061","number":"1","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":27,"createdAt":"2026-10-31T00:08:42+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":1,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-31T06:14:16.537Z"}}
